  "description": "A tiny generic finite-state machine for SetNet AI/gameplay: states with enter/update/exit, guarded transitions (and any-state transitions), driven by Update(context, dt). Engine-agnostic and allocation-light; wrap one in an IMobBrain for mob AI, or use it anywhere. No wire protocol. Depends only on SetNet.",
